{"4277040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "规则怪谈：幸存者游戏", "steam_appid": 4277040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;RuleScape：Survival&quot; is an interactive thriller where you play as He Wei, gifted with the 'Eye of Truth' to see hidden rules. In the first chapter, navigate deadly contradictions while caring for your roommate's enigmatic girlfriend. Your choices shape the story, leading to 10 distinct endings. Uncover the truth behind the horror, but beware—every revelation comes at a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, players need to complete interactive investigations by clicking specific points to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/fbe7db28f7793b5e8ff1e77ab6a48821.avif?t=1772333095\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Branches</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers numerous side storylines, where different choices lead to varied branch narratives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/选项1?t=1772333095\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decisions</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, you will encounter key decision points. Your choices in different scenarios will trigger distinct plot developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/b164c52d1bcc8be3f009a21d62c51382.avif?t=1772333095\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Judgment</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain critical moments will present options that may determine success or failure. Players must carefully consider how to respond to achieve desired outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/924508504338140bbeaea9c443aa7de9.avif?t=1772333095\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reaction</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-time events will occur during gameplay. Correct responses will smoothly advance the plot, while incorrect ones will lead to alternate story paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/072696cefd04a6126c51c34b899cf089.avif?t=1772333095\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;RuleScape：Survival&quot; is an interactive thriller where you play as He Wei, gifted with the 'Eye of Truth' to see hidden rules. In the first chapter, navigate deadly contradictions while caring for your roommate's enigmatic girlfriend. Your choices shape the story, leading to 10 distinct endings. Uncover the truth behind the horror, but beware—every revelation comes at a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation</strong>​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, players need to complete interactive investigations by clicking specific points to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277040/extras/fbe7db28f7793b5e8ff1e77ab6a48821.avif?t=1772333095\" width=15